<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Charles Ward | Speaker and Podcast Host</title>
<style>
:root{--blue:#18a4e0;--blue2:#7fd0f5;--red:#e0313f;--bg:#06101a;--bg2:#0a1b2a;--fg:#f3f9fd;--mut:#9dbbd0;--line:#1a3a52;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
:root[data-theme="light"]{--bg:#f4fafe;--bg2:#e3f2fb;--fg:#0a0a0c;--mut:#3f5565;--line:#bcdcee}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.7;font-size:1.05rem}
h1,h2,h3,nav,.btn,.pill,label,.tag{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.05;margin:0}
a{color:inherit}
header{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:9;background:rgba(6,16,26,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
nav{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
nav b{font-size:1.3rem}
nav div a{margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;color:#dbeefa}
nav div a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:0 20px}
section{padding:80px 0}
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%,#0e4a6d 0,var(--bg) 70%);padding:70px 0 0}
.sun{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-340px;width:760px;height:760px;max-width:140vw;transform:translateX(-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,#8ae0ff,var(--blue) 60%,#0c7fb5);box-shadow:0 0 120px 30px rgba(24,164,224,.45)}
.hero .wrap{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:30px;align-items:end;min-height:560px;padding-bottom:0}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.hero p{max-width:560px;color:#e8f6fd;font-size:1.15rem;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.hero .me{width:100%;max-width:400px;justify-self:end;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 15%;border-radius:200px 200px 0 0;border:5px solid #fff;border-bottom:0;display:block}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #fff;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;margin:6px 8px 6px 0}
.btn.f{background:#fff;color:#06101a}
.btn.o{background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);color:#fff}
.btn.b{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#04121b}
.tag{color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.8rem}
h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);margin:.2em 0 .5em}
p{color:var(--mut)}
.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:50px;align-items:start;max-width:800px}
.story .me{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 20%;border-radius:28px 28px 120px 28px;display:block;border:3px solid var(--blue)}
.tl{border-left:3px solid var(--blue);margin-left:8px;padding-left:26px;margin-top:26px}
.tl div{position:relative;margin-bottom:22px}
.tl div:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-36px;top:7px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}
.tl h3{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--fg)}
.tl p{margin:.2em 0 0}
.alt{background:var(--bg2)}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:34px;margin-top:34px}
.cols>div{border-top:5px solid var(--blue);padding-top:16px}
.cols>div:nth-child(2){border-color:var(--red)}
.cols h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.4em}
.pod{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center;margin-top:30px}
.vid{position:relative;display:block;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.vid img{width:100%;display:block}
.vid span{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2rem;color:#06101a;padding-left:6px}
.vid em{position:absolute;left:18px;bottom:14px;font:700 1rem system-ui,sans-serif;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 2px 8px #000;font-style:normal}
.pod ul{color:var(--mut);padding-left:20px}
.quotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:30px;margin-top:30px}
blockquote{margin:0;border-left:4px solid var(--blue);padding-left:20px;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--fg)}
blockquote cite{display:block;margin-top:8px;font:700 .9rem system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--mut);font-style:normal}
.contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px}
form{display:grid;gap:14px}
label{font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;display:grid;gap:6px}
input,select,textarea{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg2);color:var(--fg);font:inherit;width:100%}
.soc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}
.pill{border:2px solid var(--blue);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none}
.pill:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#04121b}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 20px;text-align:center;color:var(--mut);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.9rem}
@media(max-width:760px){.hero .wrap,.story,.pod,.contact{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero .me{justify-self:center;max-width:300px}.sun{bottom:-420px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><nav><b>Charles</b><div><a href="#story">My story</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a><a href="#podcast">Podcast</a><a href="#contact">Get in touch</a></div></nav></header>

<div class="hero"><div class="sun"></div>
<div class="wrap">
<div style="padding-bottom:60px">
<h1>Better days are coming.</h1>
<p>Charles left school early, found personal development in 2019 and went on to earn a business degree. Now he speaks from the heart about choosing change, facing fear and being a light for people in a dark place.</p>
<a class="btn f" href="#podcast">Watch the first episode</a><a class="btn o" href="#contact">Invite Charles to speak</a>
</div>
<img class="me" data-me alt="Charles Ward smiling at a podcast microphone">
</div></div>

<section id="story"><div class="wrap story">
<div>
<span class="tag">My story</span>
<h2>From restless to rising</h2>
<p>Charles didn't suffer from depression. He suffered from boredom: getting up, getting by, with no structure and no direction. Then one decision changed the way he thought about everything.</p>
<div class="tl">
<div><h3>School years</h3><p>He left school after fourth year. Restless, often in the principal's office and not challenged by the classroom.</p></div>
<div><h3>2019</h3><p>A friend's recommendation led him to a book on persistence. He wasn't a reader, but one idea stuck: if you decide to change, you can.</p></div>
<div><h3>Back to education</h3><p>He set his first real goals, started an advanced business course, then completed a four-year degree in business, marketing and sales.</p></div>
<div><h3>Final year</h3><p>Life interrupted his last semester. He came back the following year, finished, and graduated with a 2:1.</p></div>
<div><h3>Today</h3><p>He's building toward a life of service as a speaker and host, and doing it for his family and the next generation.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="speaking" class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<span class="tag">Speaking</span>
<h2>Talks from lived experience</h2>
<p style="max-width:620px">Charles speaks from the heart, from experience and from love. Each talk gives your audience one clear shift to make.</p>
<div class="cols">
<div><h3>False Evidence Appearing Real</h3><p>Fear and the stories we tell ourselves. How limiting beliefs form, and how to step past them. Includes his walk across hot coals.</p></div>
<div><h3>Turn the M Upside Down</h3><p>From "me" to "we". Why networking, mentors and community matter, and why one person who sees what you can't see can change your life.</p></div>
<div><h3>Don't Wait Until Monday</h3><p>Take action now. Persistence, self-talk and starting today, whether it's a business, a diet or going back to school.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="podcast"><div class="wrap">
<span class="tag">Podcast</span>
<h2>The Charles Ward 365 Podcast</h2>
<p style="max-width:620px">Believe and achieve. Charles started his podcast journey on Tune Community Radio, with host Damian Quinn. More episodes are on the way.</p>
<div class="pod">
<a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ny3Le7mEpAg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img data-ban alt="Charles Ward 365 Podcast: Believe and Achieve"><span>▶</span><em>Watch on YouTube</em></a>
<div>
<h3 style="font-size:1.8rem">Episode 1: Charles on change, fear and persistence</h3>
<p>With Damian Quinn | Tune Community Radio</p>
<ul><li>The book that changed his thinking, and the decision to go back to school</li><li>Limiting beliefs, and why one person who believes in you matters</li><li>Walking on hot coals, and jumping from a plane for charity</li><li>Why he wants to be a light for people in the dark</li></ul>
<a class="btn b" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ny3Le7mEpAg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the episode</a>
<a class="btn o" href="https://www.youtube.com/@CharlesWard365/posts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More on YouTube</a>
</div></div></div></section>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap">
<h2>In Charles's words</h2>
<div class="quotes">
<blockquote>You only need one person in your life that sees what you don't see.<cite>Charles</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote>Always be kind to yourself and everything else will fall into place.<cite>Charles</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote>Today doesn't define tomorrow. The sun will rise for everyone. It's what we do with the day that matters.<cite>Charles</cite></blockquote>
</div></div></section>

